                "readme": "<h1>DWE_OS 2.0</h1>\n<p>DWE_OS is an optional piece of software \u2014 designed to run on underwater systems \u2014 that allows for extended functionality of <a href=\"https://dwe.ai/collections/all\">DeepWater Exploration cameras</a>. It provides out-of-the-box camera streaming and customization features, minimizing the development time typically required for subsea camera integration.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"DWE_OS\" src=\"https://mintlify.s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com/deepwaterexplorationinc/software/images/dwe_os_2/dwe-os-2-demo-page.png\"/></p>\n<p>For more information, please see our <a href=\"https://docs.dwe.ai/software/dwe-os/dwe-os-2\">documentation site</a>.</p>",
                "support": "https://dwe.ai/pages/contact",
                "requirements": null,
                "company": {
                    "about": "",
                    "name": "DeepWater Exploration",
                    "email": "support@dwe.ai"
                },
