                "readme": "<h1>blueos-jupyter</h1>\n<p>Extension to start coding with python examples and create projects.</p>\n<p>To install your own libraries, use: <code>pip install --user</code>.</p>\n<p>Home directory (<code>/root/</code>) will be persistent besides pip local holder for user libraries.</p>\n<p>Libraries installed:\n- bluerobotics-ping\n- bluerobotics-navigator\n- plotly\n- pymavlink</p>",
                "support": null,
                "requirements": null,
                "company": {
